<%# 填寫頁單一檢查項目的截圖縮圖區（伺服器端渲染一次、就地儲存後也由伺服器重新渲染這一塊交給前端換上，兩邊永遠一致） %>
<% if (photos.length > 0) { %>
  <div class="photo-thumb-list">
    <% photos.forEach((photo, pi) => { %>
      <div class="photo-thumb-list__item">
        <a href="/uploads/<%= batch.id %>/<%= photo.filename %>" data-viewer="viewer-<%= itemId %>" data-label="<%= assetName %>・<%= itemLabel %>・截圖 <%= pi + 1 %>" title="點一下就地放大檢視">
          <img class="screenshot-thumb" src="/uploads/<%= batch.id %>/<%= photo.filename %>" alt="已上傳截圖">
        </a>
        <button type="submit" form="photo-delete-<%= photo.id %>" class="photo-thumb-list__delete" title="刪除這張截圖">刪除</button>
      </div>
    <% }) %>
  </div>
  <div id="viewer-<%= itemId %>" class="photo-viewer-host" data-viewer-host hidden></div>
<% } %>
